# Invite links: serve the fallback page at the ORIGINAL /j/<token> URL.
# This must be a rewrite (200), not a 3xx redirect — a redirect to /j drops the
# token and breaks cold-start joining. If a Cloudflare dashboard Redirect Rule
# also matches /j/*, remove it or make it a rewrite so it can't shadow these.
/j      /j.html  200
/j/*    /j.html  200
